*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.tar binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.bin binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.mkv binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary
